I'm not quite sure what you're asking. What's wrong with doing the following?

plot(mod, type = 'trace', which.items = 1:50)
plot(mod, type = 'trace', which.items = 51:100)

That seems to do what you want. The problem may be in your other customized inputs, but I don't see what it is off hand.

Phil

